  "translation": "Today I went to the supermarket with my mom to buy things. In the supermarket there were many people. First we went to the fruit area. Mom asked: \"What do you want to buy?\" I said: \"I want to buy apples and bananas.\" Mom bought two apples and half a jin of bananas. Then we went to the milk tea area. Mom asked: \"Can you drink milk tea?\" I said: \"Can, I very much want to drink.\" Mom then bought me one cup of milk tea. We spent forty yuan in total. After returning home, I felt very happy."
